@@ -450,3 +450,25 @@ cmd/curator	TestProfileImportUseLockedRequireRefuses	linux,darwin,windows	-	-	im
 cmd/curator	TestProfileUpdateResyncPassesLockedRequire	linux,darwin,windows	-	-	an update that moves the lock re-switches the required profile through the same seam gate
